{"id":"309e6b4c626877fe","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-atom.md","title":"ZFC Poset Atom","display":"df-zfc-poset-atom — ZFC Poset Atom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-atom","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-atom"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-atom — ZFC Poset Atom","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-atom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-atom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-atom — ZFC Poset Atom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,P,0_P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(a,P,0_P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span> (candidate atom, bounded poset, least element, and order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}\\)</span> (partial-order predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetAtom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetAtom}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}atom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetAtom}_S(a,P,0_P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land0_P,a\\in P\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\langle0_P,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\land a\\neq0_P\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\Bigl((\\langle0_P,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle x,a\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\to(x=0_P\\lor x=a)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}atom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetAtom}_S(a,P,0_P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land0_P,a\\in P\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\langle0_P,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\land a\\neq0_P\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\Bigl((\\langle0_P,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle x,a\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\to(x=0_P\\lor x=a)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The least element and atom are typed explicitly, and order comparisons are membership in the supplied relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,P,0_P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetAtom}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}atom} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetAtom}_S(a,P,0_P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land0_P,a\\in P\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\langle0_P,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\land a\\neq0_P\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\Bigl((\\langle0_P,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle x,a\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\to(x=0_P\\lor x=a)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":943,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-atom.md|58-df-zfc-poset-atom]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["83dfbde66bc78255"]}